* 2013.02.19	- Minor corrections in text.
*		- Added -+ (b-a) and /* (b/a), increasing flexibility in design,
*		along with a new symbol, Math2rT.asy.
* 2014.04.08	- Modified mod to have int() instead of floor().
*
********************************************************************************
